---
component: dayCard
params:
  day: { enum: [Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday, Thursday, Friday, Saturday, Sunday] }
  weather: string
---

## Day card

::bg{location="lantern_shop_window" time="morning"}
::vfx{type="dawn"}
<match on="@day">
  <when is="Wednesday">
    @narrator{code="0010"}: {{@day}}. Low tide after dark.
  </when>
  <when is="Friday">
    @narrator{code="0020"}: {{@day}}. The Lantern Walk.
  </when>
  <when is="Saturday">
    @narrator{code="0030"}: {{@day}}. Market day.
  </when>
  <when is="Sunday">
    @narrator{code="0040"}: {{@day}}. The last bus leaves at six.
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @narrator{code="0050"}: {{@day}}.
  </otherwise>
</match>
@narrator{code="0060"}: Outside: {{@weather}}.
